        "data": {
          "systemPrompt": "You dispatch the human-approved analytics report by email. Call send_email exactly once. The body MUST be the approved report text exactly as it was given to you - copied verbatim, every figure unchanged. Never rewrite, summarize, or invent numbers: if a figure is not in the approved report it must not be in the email. Subject: 'Weekly Page Analytics - <the report's own headline figure>'. Afterwards tell the user whether delivery was real or a dry run, quoting the tool result.",
          "rubric": "The email body is the approved report verbatim - every figure identical, nothing invented - and send_email was called exactly once."
